<%# locals: (person:) %>
<%# The six-hour notice is a counting rule, which on a report would fold into the
    page's card. It stays a visible warning by the owner's ruling (2026-10-02):
    this partial also draws a Ranger's own Work History, where it is a rule
    they can act on, and the three pages that share it stay alike. %>
<%= ui_callout_box :warning do %>
  Starting in 2025, a minimum of 6 hours must be volunteered at each event for it to count as having Rangered that
  event.
<% end %>
<dl class="ui-label-value">
  <dt class="font-medium text-heading">Rangered events:</dt>
  <dd>
    <% if person.years_as_ranger.any? %>
      <%= pluralize person.years_as_ranger.size, "event" %>
      <span class="text-stone-muted">[<%= year_range person.years_as_ranger %>]</span>
    <% else %>
      <span class="text-stone-muted italic">none</span>
    <% end %>
  </dd>
  <% if person.years_as_contributor.any? %>
    <dt>As Echelon volunteer:</dt>
    <dd>
      <%= pluralize person.years_as_contributor.size, "event" %>
      <span class="text-stone-muted">[<%= year_range person.years_as_contributor %>]</span>
    </dd>
  <% end %>

  <dt>Service years:</dt>
  <dd>
    <% if person.years_of_service.any? %>
      <%= pluralize person.years_of_service.size, "year" %>
      <span class="text-stone-muted">[<%= year_range person.years_of_service %>]</span>
    <% else %>
      <span class="text-stone-muted italic">none</span>
    <% end %>
  </dd>
</dl>

